<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>GTA 5</Major>
    <Description>A small and ezzy Macro for Automate Farmin in GTA 5 Roleplay Server. Press only the Key u selected on Keyran and it starts automatic for 16 min.

Have fun!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 5 s
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 5 s
GoWhile 1 50000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>